	<!-- Changelog
	29-04-2025: Removed PTO element from IEPC vehicles and NgTankSystem from vehicles without ICE. Added NgTankSystem to multiple-SHEV Primary Bus.
	10-05-2025: Replaced AUX_Component_FCHV_LorryType with AUX_Component_PEV_Lorry_Type because AUX_Component_FCHV_LorryType was wrong and redundant.
	15-05-2025: Added H2StorageUsableCapacityType for H2StorageUsableCapacity
	16-05-2025: Added H2 elements to PHEV and SHEV vehicles.
	27-05-2025: Making new fields of completed buses optional (multiple OEMs can be involved in completed buses).
	17-06-2025: Removed NgTankSystem from multiple-SHEV Primary Bus.
	17-06-2025: Removed Retarder from components of X4 architectures.
	17-06-2025: Set correct RetarderType for multiple powertrains retarder type.
	15-07-2025: Removed redundant types: Vehicle_Multiple_SHEV_CompletedBusDeclarationType, Vehicle_Multiple_PEV_CompletedBusDeclarationType,
		Vehicle_Multiple_FCHV_CompletedBusDeclarationType.
	23-07-2025: FCHV Completed Bus: H2 properties appear both or not at all.
	04-08-2025: Added missing type: AirDragModifiedUseStandardValueType.
	21-05-2026: Added optional element 'ExtraTechnologies' to Monitoring Data of all (non-exempted) vehicle types.
	-->

